      "text": "『 #HoneyThePHUWIN 🎂 』\n\nDonation Goal Surpass!🎉\n\nFor everyone who has helped to make this project successful. I thank you from the bottom of my heart. This could not be done alone. We are stronger together. 🩵🩵\n\nPondPhuwin Philippines FC prepared a comprehensive transparency sheet to ensure every donation is accounted for and used with purpose.\n\n📌 Phuwin’s Birthday Funds Breakdown:\n🔗 https://t.co/JBpqF55LcP\n\n📌 Full Transparency Sheet:\n🔗 https://t.co/BpjozO7yOB\n\nFor any questions or clarifications, feel free to reach out to out.\nThank you once again for your generosity and trust!\n\n@phuwintang\n@PondPhuwinPH_ \n#phuwintang \n#winniethephu\n#HoneyThePHUWIN",
